        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="why" value="Why a move saves nothing: the 178M lives in history, and every merged PR body holds SHA-pinned raw links that need those blobs forever. Only a history rewrite shrinks it — and that breaks every old evidence link" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
